@startuml PublicDemo
title Talkboard public demo
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Open separate public app container;
if (Saved board exists?) then (yes)
  :Load saved board and its own media;
else (no)
  :Show generic home vocabulary
with licensed bundled images;
endif
:Show bounded page arrows, Home,
page indicators and ABC / 123 entry;
note right
People starts empty.
A new tap replaces old audio.
No personal content is bundled.
end note
if (Caregiver edits?) then (yes)
  :Authenticate and edit chosen saved board;
  if (First save of illustrated demo?) then (yes)
    :Copy referenced bundled images
into the local board store;
  endif
  :Publish and verify saved generation;
  :Use saved media on later edits;
endif
:Keep communication available;
stop
legend
Code: Apache 2.0.
Artwork: separate CC BY-NC-SA, CC BY-SA and Pexels terms.
Letter pronunciation and physical-device acceptance remain open.
endlegend
@enduml
